=== noninc-ctrl-w-is-unix-word-rubout
tags: non-incremental-reverse-search-history
--- script
readline "> "
--- keys
\M-p\s'\C-w<dump>\C-g\C-y<dump>\r

=== callback-isearch-ignores-eof
tags: reverse-search-history callback eof
--- script
callback "prompt$ " 1
--- keys
\C-r

=== failed-previous-history-keeps-edits-in-entry
tags: beginning-of-history undo
--- script
add_history "gamma"
readline "> " 1
history_dump
--- keys
\M-<\M-b\C-d\M-<<dumpfull>

=== failed-previous-history-then-eof
tags: beginning-of-history
--- script
add_history "beta"
readline "> " 1
history_dump
--- keys
<up>X\M-<
